verdicts.note:
Upheld with two corrections. The core claim holds:
- md:122 says 'No observation permission currently exists', and json:288 authority is null;
- the record form, issuance and verification are undefined;
- the nonce is minted at request time (supervisor.mjs:1172@25858ad);
- per-command admission checks only a non-empty string (1101-1102);
- manifest admission.observations 'The supervisor never samples' and handshake.mechanism are reversed by md:122 without the reversal being flagged.
Corrections: maximumObservations===1 at :377 governs only the HOST_PRE_WINDOW and EFFECTIVE_POLICY authorities (:361-363), so it is a design choice, not a conflict. NO_AUTOMATIC_PROBE_OR_RETRY is at :1181, not :1180. This blocks execution, not the conditional source decision.

